{"unit_id":"MikatoMisaka__dsh-desktop-notify#card-zh","repo":"MikatoMisaka/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"613e597e635117e3245c1ad7021bb26ede152b05","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 是一款面向 DSH 桌面端的系统通知插件。它将通知处理接入 DSH Host 和渲染进程：Windows 由 Host 发出系统 toast，macOS 等非 Windows 平台由渲染进程显示通知。主要功能包括任务完成提醒、等待提问或确认时提醒、通知正文预览，以及点击通知返回对应会话；用户还可选择提醒触发时机。适合需要离开 DSH 窗口时及时获知任务状态的桌面用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务，需在 DSH profile 中安装并启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:84-108","lib/index.js:253-285","lib/client.js:294-340","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"MikatoMisaka__dsh-desktop-notify#card-en","repo":"MikatoMisaka/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"613e597e635117e3245c1ad7021bb26ede152b05","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-notify adds system alerts to DSH for completed runs and pending questions or approvals. It shows reply previews, lets users choose when alerts appear, and opens the matching session when clicked. Windows uses host toasts; macOS uses renderer notifications. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:84-108","lib/index.js:253-285","lib/client.js:294-340","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
