{"unit_id":"MikatoMisaka__dsh-desktop-notify#feature-1","repo":"MikatoMisaka/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"613e597e635117e3245c1ad7021bb26ede152b05","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 的功能「任务状态提醒」：任务完成或 DSH 等待提问、计划审阅、工具确认时显示系统通知；用户可设置在未聚焦、最小化或始终提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:19-24","lib/client.js:294-340"]}
{"unit_id":"MikatoMisaka__dsh-desktop-notify#feature-2","repo":"MikatoMisaka/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"613e597e635117e3245c1ad7021bb26ede152b05","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 的功能「通知跳转会话」：点击通知后打开该通知关联的 DSH 会话；客户端通过会话 ID 导航，Windows 另由协议传递通知点击信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:322-340","lib/index.js:345-388","lib/platform/windows.js:22-25"]}
{"unit_id":"MikatoMisaka__dsh-desktop-notify#feature-3","repo":"MikatoMisaka/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"613e597e635117e3245c1ad7021bb26ede152b05","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 的功能「完成回复预览」：Host 在一轮结束时记录最后一条 assistant 回复，并在任务完成通知中显示截短后的正文；无预览时使用默认完成提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:124-169","lib/index.js:251-265","lib/index.js:424-432"]}
{"unit_id":"MikatoMisaka__dsh-desktop-notify#feature-4","repo":"MikatoMisaka/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"613e597e635117e3245c1ad7021bb26ede152b05","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 的功能「提醒时机设置」：在 DSH 设置页选择未聚焦时、最小化时或始终发送提醒；选择保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:68-102","lib/client.js:188-194"]}
{"unit_id":"MikatoMisaka__dsh-desktop-notify#caveat-1","repo":"MikatoMisaka/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"613e597e635117e3245c1ad7021bb26ede152b05","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 使用前须知：macOS 的提醒由渲染进程调用系统通知，首次使用需允许通知；应用退出后，点击通知无法跳回原会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:322-340","docs/macos-adaptation.md:121-138"]}
